    title: "The unknown-receiver-scope caveat's denominator counts receiverless calls as method call sites (Go package functions, Java statics), understating the untyped share (alertmanager: printed 18.5%, ~31% over real method sites)"  # 7aae
    status: todo_hard  # 7aae
    priority: 2  # 7aae
    parent:  # 7aae
